{"3962470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coaster Crash Course", "steam_appid": 3962470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b7c85832f6469e3563be1b85c18be27d.poster.avif?t=1765801333\" width=776 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b7c85832f6469e3563be1b85c18be27d.webm?t=1765801333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b7c85832f6469e3563be1b85c18be27d.mp4?t=1765801333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coaster Crash Course is a roller coaster building puzzle game. In a series of different levels you are challenged to build the optimal roller coaster taking the terrain and a set of collectibles into account. Be wary of physics, though: Too high speeds combined with too tight curves or slopes and your coaster will turn into a rocket. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b73bd849397ba90b3350b48b893decf9.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building tool is incredibly simple and intuitive and designed in a way that allows you to build your own coasters within seconds. No complicated UI, no steep learning curve, doesn't feel like work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/5cd985ed5d1400029a6f60be7875df53.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your way through various kinds of challenges spread out over different colorful environments. Along your journey new mechanics and obstacles are introduced which will require increasingly creative roller coaster designs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/8eeddb8bbd7b6f9ed026d5b1118dd54c.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items like the speed orb will push your coaster to the absolute limits of physics. Can your track handle the high speed or will your train launch into the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/7362235dea3caa7c9c87f2033799b6b7.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a sea of roller coaster simulations, this game provides a fresh and original experience and dares to explore new frontiers. Relax and take a step into this weird and wonderful world of roller coasters!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b7c85832f6469e3563be1b85c18be27d.poster.avif?t=1765801333\" width=776 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b7c85832f6469e3563be1b85c18be27d.webm?t=1765801333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b7c85832f6469e3563be1b85c18be27d.mp4?t=1765801333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coaster Crash Course is a roller coaster building puzzle game. In a series of different levels you are challenged to build the optimal roller coaster taking the terrain and a set of collectibles into account. Be wary of physics, though: Too high speeds combined with too tight curves or slopes and your coaster will turn into a rocket. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/b73bd849397ba90b3350b48b893decf9.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building tool is incredibly simple and intuitive and designed in a way that allows you to build your own coasters within seconds. No complicated UI, no steep learning curve, doesn't feel like work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/5cd985ed5d1400029a6f60be7875df53.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your way through various kinds of challenges spread out over different colorful environments. Along your journey new mechanics and obstacles are introduced which will require increasingly creative roller coaster designs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/8eeddb8bbd7b6f9ed026d5b1118dd54c.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items like the speed orb will push your coaster to the absolute limits of physics. Can your track handle the high speed or will your train launch into the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962470/extras/7362235dea3caa7c9c87f2033799b6b7.avif?t=1765801333\" width=777 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a sea of roller coaster simulations, this game provides a fresh and original experience and dares to explore new frontiers. Relax and take a s